# The Movie Database (TMDB) API Configuration
# Get your free API key at: https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
# 1. Sign up / Log in to TMDB
# 2. Go to Account Settings -> API -> Request an API Key (Developer)
# 3. Copy your "API Key (v3 auth)" or "API Read Access Token (v4)"
# 4. Paste it below into your .env file:

VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=your_tmdb_api_key_here
